 msgctxt "#32363"
-msgid "How much of the dynamic range compression that AC-3 and E-AC-3 tracks ask for is applied when Kodi decodes them: 100 % (as Kodi) applies all of it, which brings loud passages down and quiet ones up; 0 % applies none, the full range of the mix. Not for sound that is passed through: there the receiver applies its own. Applies at once. <applydrc> in advancedsettings.xml, where it is set, takes priority."
+msgid "How much of the volume levelling that Dolby Digital tracks (AC-3 and E-AC-3) ask for is applied when Hades decodes them. 100 % (the default, as in Kodi): all of it, which brings loud passages down and quiet ones up. 0 %: none, the full range of the mix. Not for sound that is passed through: there your receiver applies its own. Takes effect at once. <applydrc> in advancedsettings.xml, where it is set, takes priority."
 msgstr ""
 
